  "group": "mini",
  "prompt": "What is the tax rate on the sale of shares not traded on a stock exchange?",
  "runtimeCommit": "1b36eeadb26d69f2b9ae28c8422afcc3fdd5c6d2",
  "answer": "### Short Answer\nThe tax rate on the sale of shares not traded on a stock exchange is 20% if the holding period is less than three years, 12% if held for three to less than four years, and 5% if held for four to less than five years. This is based on the provisions of RR 2-98 regarding the taxation of capital gains from the sale of shares.",
